WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.038
Step seven reads the sponsor
fields Chapter 2 recorded,

2
00:00:04.038 --> 00:00:06.813
now filled for all eight A I identities.

3
00:00:06.813 --> 00:00:11.385
Case Triage Agent has carol as both
its sponsor and its technical owner,

4
00:00:11.385 --> 00:00:15.337
so whoever decides the agent
should exist also holds its keys.

5
00:00:15.337 --> 00:00:17.300
Records Search Agent is orphaned.

6
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:22.730
And Sandbox Helper has no sponsor, no
inventory record and no handshake at all.
